3. Email Content Analysis

The email attempts to impersonate Microsoft account security and creates urgency by reporting a suspicious login attempt.
Indicators of phishing include:
Domain spoofing / typosquatting
Urgent security warning
Request to review account activity
Embedded login link
Non-official sender domain
Example malicious link:
https://m1crosoftsupport.co/login
Legitimate Microsoft domains typically include:

microsoft.com
account.microsoft.com
login.microsoftonline.com

The domain m1crosoftsupport.co substitutes the letter "i" with the number "1", a common phishing technique.

